---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
kicker: Get in touch
lead: Questions about the study, interview requests or feedback? We'd like to hear from you.
description: Contact the AI & People at Work team – for media and the general public.
---

<div class="contact-grid">
  <section class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="media-heading">
    <h2 id="media-heading">Media</h2>
    <p>For interviews, background information and figures.</p>
    <p><strong>{{ site.contact.mediaPerson }}</strong><br>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.media }}">{{ site.contact.media }}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="general-heading">
    <h2 id="general-heading">General questions</h2>
    <p>For everyone else – questions about the study, the report or this website.</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.general }}">{{ site.contact.general }}</a></p>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="form-heading">
  <h2 id="form-heading">Send us a message</h2>
  <form class="form" aria-describedby="form-status">
    <fieldset disabled>
      <div class="form__row">
        <label for="contact-name">Name</label>
        <input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name">
      </div>
      <div class="form__row">
        <label for="contact-email">Email</label>
        <input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="form__row">
        <label for="contact-topic">Topic</label>
        <select id="contact-topic" name="topic">
          <option>Media request</option>
          <option>Question about the study</option>
          <option>Feedback</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="form__row">
        <label for="contact-message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="5"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
    </fieldset>
  </form>
  <p id="form-status" class="muted">The contact form is not active yet – please use the email addresses above.</p>

  {% todo "Contact form" %}
This website is static (no server), so the form needs a form service or a university form. Requirements: no cookies or tracking, data stored in Switzerland/EU if possible, spam protection without third-party captchas. Add the service's domain to the Content Security Policy in `src/_includes/layouts/base.njk` (`form-action`) and describe it on the privacy page.
  {% endtodo %}
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="social-heading">
  <h2 id="social-heading">Follow the project</h2>
  {% todo "Social media" %}
Links to the project's or the Chair's social media profiles – add them in `src/_data/site.yaml` (they then also appear in the footer).
  {% endtodo %}
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="feedback-heading">
  <h2 id="feedback-heading">Feedback</h2>
  {% todo "Open question" %}
Where and when do we collect feedback from visitors? Options: a "Was this useful?" question at the end of the self-check, a topic in the contact form, or a short feedback link on theme pages. Decide, then implement.
  {% endtodo %}
</section>
